      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Update [1500-something]\n\nMy Spookality avatar has what appears to be a massive box interaction displaying below it on mobile. This avatar uses GoGoLoco Beyond (converted to VRC Constraints) and switches between two skinned renderers, but otherwise has nothing special on it.\n\nAvatar: https://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_0ae41d3f-ae4a-437d-b429-4b1dbb217d20",
