  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-09-01T06:33:26.766Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "In the attached images you can see the Bat and Octane follower on the remote user are highlighted blue as if interactive. Both of these objects use VRCConstraints: the follower has a Position and Rotation constraint and a physbone, and the bat has a single Parent constraint.\n\nThese are only visible within the typical interaction range.\n\n(Unsure why the follower is visually that far away but that's a separate issue that may or may not be my fault)",
